Subject: [PATCH 34/38] Finder: Stoplights back to the window decorations size

14.5 px circles 8.8 px apart, as every other window (the 16 px ones read
as too big next to them). The lift and the drawn glyphs stay.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KdkdNUmoM62iDwjRop6X5f
---
 src/finder/finderchrome.cpp | 8 ++++----
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/finder/finderchrome.cpp b/src/finder/finderchrome.cpp
index 47dc8bed0..970765b0d 100644
--- a/src/finder/finderchrome.cpp
+++ b/src/finder/finderchrome.cpp
@@ -139,10 +139,10 @@ public:
     }
 
 protected:
-    // A little larger than the window decorations' (MacSequoia draws ~22 px
-    // circles 35 px apart at 1.5×); the user preferred them bigger.
-    static constexpr qreal Diameter = 16;
-    static constexpr qreal Gap = 8;
+    // Sized like the window decorations' (MacSequoia draws ~22 px
+    // circles 35 px apart at 1.5×), so all windows' stoplights match.
+    static constexpr qreal Diameter = 14.5;
+    static constexpr qreal Gap = 8.8;
     static constexpr int LeftMargin = 8;
     static constexpr int RightMargin = 14;
 
